<a href=/contact.html class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 hover:text-indigo-600 uppercase tracking-wider hidden md:block">Contact</a></div></div><div class=mt-4><div class="relative search-bar"><i class="fas fa-search absolute left-4 top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 text-gray-400"></i>
<input id=search-input placeholder="Search tools, resources, and services..." class="w-full pl-12 pr-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent"></div></div></div></header><section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-50 to-white border-b py-8"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center"><div class=lg:col-span-7><div id=hero-intro-en class=hero-intro><h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">The AI Agent Ecosystem, Organized</h2><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">AgDex curates <strong>716+ tools</strong> across 8 categories — from foundational frameworks like LangChain, CrewAI, and AutoGen, to LLM APIs, GPU cloud providers, memory systems, and developer tools. Manually reviewed and updated regularly.<p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-500">Not sure where to start? Read our <a href=/blog/ai-agent-frameworks-guide-2026.html class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-bold">complete 2026 framework guide</a> or compare <a href=/blog/langchain-vs-crewai-vs-autogen.html class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-bold">LangChain vs CrewAI vs AutoGen</a>.</div><div id=hero-intro-es class=hero-intro style=display:none><h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">El ecosistema de agentes IA, organizado</h2><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">AgDex organiza <strong>más de 450 herramientas</strong> en 8 categorías — desde frameworks fundamentales como LangChain, CrewAI y AutoGen, hasta APIs de LLM, GPU cloud, sistemas de memoria y herramientas para desarrolladores.<p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-500">¿No sabes por dónde empezar? Lee nuestra <a href=/blog/ai-agent-frameworks-guide-2026.html class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-bold">guía completa 2026</a> o compara <a href=/blog/langchain-vs-crewai-vs-autogen.html class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-bold">LangChain vs CrewAI vs AutoGen</a>.</div><div id=hero-intro-de class=hero-intro style=display:none><h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">Das KI-Agent-Ökosystem, strukturiert</h2><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">AgDex kuratiert <strong>716+ Tools</strong> in 8 Kategorien — von grundlegenden Frameworks wie LangChain, CrewAI und AutoGen bis hin zu LLM-APIs, GPU-Cloud, Memory-Systemen und Entwicklertools.<p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-500">Wo anfangen? Lesen Sie unseren <a href=/blog/ai-agent-frameworks-guide-2026.html class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-bold">vollständigen 2026-Leitfaden</a> oder vergleichen Sie <a href=/blog/langchain-vs-crewai-vs-autogen.html class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-bold">LangChain vs CrewAI vs AutoGen</a>.</div><div id=hero-intro-ja class=hero-intro style=display:none><h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">AIエージェントエコシステムを、体系的に</h2><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">AgDexは<strong>450以上のツール</strong>を8カテゴリに整理しています — LangChain・CrewAI・AutoGenなどの基盤フレームワークから、LLM API、GPU クラウド、メモリシステム、開発者ツールまで網羅。<p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-500">どこから始めるべきか迷っていますか？ <a href=/blog/ai-agent-frameworks-guide-2026.html class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-bold">2026年版完全ガイド</a>を読むか、<a href=/blog/langchain-vs-crewai-vs-autogen.html class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-bold">LangChain vs CrewAI vs AutoGen 比較</a>をご覧ください。</div></div><div class=lg:col-span-5><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-xl p-6 md:p-8 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-24 h-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-cyan-400 opacity-20 rounded-full blur-xl pointer-events-none"></div><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50/50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-indigo-100">Out-Of-Box AI</span><h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-800 mt-4 mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fas fa-magic text-indigo-500"></i>
