<span id=total-count class="font-semibold text-gray-900">0</span> resources</div><div><select id=sort-select class="px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg text-sm"><option value=featured id=sort-opt-featured>Featured First<option value=name id=sort-opt-name>Name (A-Z)<option value=stars id=sort-opt-stars>Most Stars</select></div></div><div id=loading class="text-center py-20"><div class="loading mx-auto mb-4"></div><p class=text-gray-500>Loading resources...</div><div id=products-grid class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 hidden"></div><div id=empty-state class="text-center py-20 hidden"><div class="text-6xl mb-4">🔍</div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">No results found</h3><p class=text-gray-500>Try adjusting your search or filters</div><section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 border-t border-b bg-gray-50/50 rounded-xl my-10"><div id=faq-hub-en class="faq-hub space-y-6"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-book-open text-indigo-600"></i> AI Agent Directory: Frequently Asked Questions & Knowledge Hub</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">Q1: What is an AI Agent?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">An AI Agent is an autonomous software system powered by a Large Language Model (LLM) that can perceive its environment, make decisions, use tools (APIs, databases, browsers), and execute multi-step workflows to achieve specific goals without constant human intervention.</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">Q2: What is the difference between an AI Agent and a Chatbot?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">While traditional chatbots are reactive and respond only to direct prompts in a single turn, AI Agents are proactive and goal-driven. Agents can break down a complex objective into sequential tasks, run autonomous loops, browse the web, write and execute code, and self-correct their errors until the goal is fully accomplished.</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">Q3: How do I choose the best AI agent framework?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">For complex, stateful multi-agent systems, <strong>LangGraph</strong> or <strong>AutoGen</strong> are industry leaders. For role-playing team simulations, <strong>CrewAI</strong> is highly effective and easy to configure. For rapid, visual, no-code prototyping, <strong>Dify</strong> and <strong>Langflow</strong> offer incredible drag-and-drop builders.</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">Q4: What is the Model Context Protocol (MCP)?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open standard developed by Anthropic that acts as a universal bridge, allowing LLMs and AI assistants to securely connect to external data sources, filesystems, databases, and third-party APIs using a single, unified protocol.</div></div></div><div id=faq-hub-es class="faq-hub space-y-6" style=display:none><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-book-open text-indigo-600"></i> Directorio de Agentes de IA: Preguntas Frecuentes y Centro de Conocimiento</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">P1: ¿Qué es un Agente de IA?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Un Agente de IA es un sistema de software autónomo impulsado por un Modelo de Lenguaje Grande (LLM) que puede percibir su entorno, tomar decisiones, usar herramientas (APIs, bases de datos, navegadores) y ejecutar flujos de trabajo de múltiples pasos para lograr objetivos específicos sin intervención humana constante.</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">P2: ¿Cuál es la diferencia entre un Agente de IA y un Chatbot?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">A diferencia de los chatbots tradicionales que solo responden de forma reactiva a prompts directos, los Agentes de IA son proactivos y orientados a objetivos. Pueden desglosar un objetivo complejo en tareas secuenciales, ejecutar bucles autónomos, usar navegadores web, escribir código y autocorregir sus errores.</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">P3: ¿Cómo elijo el mejor framework de agentes de IA?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Para sistemas complejos y con estado, <strong>LangGraph</strong> o <strong>AutoGen</strong> son líderes. Para simulaciones de equipos con roles, <strong>CrewAI</strong> es altamente efectivo. Para prototipado rápido sin código, <strong>Dify</strong> y <strong>Langflow</strong> ofrecen increíbles editores visuales.</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">P4: ¿Qué es el Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP)?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">El Model Context Protocol (MCP) es un estándar abierto desarrollado por Anthropic que actúa como un puente universal, permitiendo que los LLM y asistentes de IA se conecten de forma segura a bases de datos, sistemas de archivos y APIs externas.</div></div></div><div id=faq-hub-de class="faq-hub space-y-6" style=display:none><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-book-open text-indigo-600"></i> KI-Agenten-Verzeichnis: Häufig gestellte Fragen & Wissensdatenbank</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">F1: Was ist ein KI-Agent?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Ein KI-Agent ist ein autonomes Softwaresystem, das auf einem Large Language Model (LLM) basiert. Es kann seine Umgebung wahrnehmen, Entscheidungen treffen, Tools nutzen und mehrstufige Workflows ausführen, um bestimmte Ziele ohne ständige menschliche Aufsicht zu erreichen.</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">F2: Was ist der Unterschied zwischen einem KI-Agenten und einem Chatbot?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Herkömmliche Chatbots reagieren nur auf direkte Prompts. KI-Agenten hingegen sind proaktiv und zielorientiert. Sie können komplexe Ziele in Teilaufgaben zerlegen, autonome Schleifen ausführen, im Web surfen, Code schreiben und Fehler selbstständig korrigieren.</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">F3: Wie wähle ich das beste KI-Agent-Framework aus?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Für komplexe, zustandsbehaftete Systeme sind <strong>LangGraph</strong> oder <strong>AutoGen</strong> Branchenführer. Für rollenbasierte Teamsimulationen ist <strong>CrewAI</strong> sehr effektiv. Für schnelles, visuelles No-Code-Prototyping bieten <strong>Dify</strong> und <strong>Langflow</strong> Drag-and-Drop-Builder.</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">F4: Was ist das Model Context Protocol (MCP)?</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Das Model Context Protocol (MCP) ist ein von Anthropic entwickelter offener Standard, der als universelle Brücke fungiert, um LLMs und KI-Assistenten sicher mit externen Datenbanken und APIs zu verbinden.</div></div></div><div id=faq-hub-ja class="faq-hub space-y-6" style=display:none><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-book-open text-indigo-600"></i> AIエージェントディレクトリ：よくある質問とナレッジハブ</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">Q1: AIエージェントとは何ですか？</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">AIエージェントとは、大規模言語モデル（LLM）を搭載した自律的なソフトウェアシステムです。人間の継続的な介入なしに、環境を認識し、意思決定を行い、ツールを使用し、マルチステップのワークフローを実行して特定の目標を達成します。</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">Q2: AIエージェントとチャットボットの違いは何ですか？</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">従来のチャットボットが単一ターンのプロンプトに反応するだけであるのに対し、AIエージェントは自律的に行動します。複雑な目標をシーケンシャルなタスクに分解し、自律ループを実行し、Webをブラウズし、コードを記述・実行し、エラーを自己修正します。</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">Q3: 最適なAIエージェントフレームワークはどのように選べばよいですか？</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">複雑な状態管理が必要な場合は <strong>LangGraph</strong> や <strong>AutoGen</strong> が業界トップです。役割分担型のチーム連携には <strong>CrewAI</strong> が設定しやすく強力です。ノーコードでの迅速なプロトタイプ構築には、<strong>Dify</strong> や <strong>Langflow</strong> がおすすめです。</div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">Q4: モデルコンテキストプロトコル（MCP）とは何ですか？</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Model Context Protocol（MCP）はAnthropicが提唱するオープン標準であり、LLMやAIアシスタントを安全に外部データソースやAPIに接続するための万能なコネクタ（架け橋）として機能します。</div></div></div></section></main><section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-14 border-t"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">🔬 In-Depth Tool Reviews</h2><a href=/tools/ class="text-sm text-indigo-600 font-medium hover:underline">All reviews →</a></div><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-6">We test and review the most important AI agent tools — honest pros & cons, real pricing, and who each tool is actually for.<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4"><a href=/tools/chatgpt.html class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm p-4 hover:shadow-md hover:border-indigo-200 transition-all group"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><span class=text-xl>💬</span>
